# Stack Test
# Zinc (Zn) — real density 7.14 g/cm³. three cubes stacked — simulate: collapse checks the load path.
scene "Zinc Stack Test"

bottom = cube 20mm material: zinc at (0, 10mm, 0)
middle = cube 20mm material: zinc at (0, 30mm, 0)
top = cube 20mm material: zinc at (0, 50mm, 0)
simulate: collapse
